.SH NOTES
To use \fBiapws\fP within your fpm project, add the following to your fpm.toml file:
.nf
.ft CR
        [dependencies]
        iapws = { git="https://github.com/MilanSkocic/iapws.git" }

.ft R
.fi

.PP
dp stands for double precision and it is an alias to real64
from the iso_fortran_env module.

